{"format":"hologram.registry.artifact/v1","id":"mcr.microsoft.com/azure-cognitive-services/speechservices/custom-text-to-speech","fetched":"2026-09-25T12:12:03.345Z","source":{"name":"Microsoft Artifact Registry","api":"https://mcr.microsoft.com/api/v1/catalog/azure-cognitive-services/speechservices/custom-text-to-speech/details?reg=mar","page":"https://mcr.microsoft.com/en-us/product/azure-cognitive-services/speechservices/custom-text-to-speech/about"},"readme":"## About\n\n[Azure AI services](http://aka.ms/cognitive-services) is a set of APIs, SDKs and container images that enables developers to integrate ready-made AI directly into their applications. Azure AI services contains a broad set of capabilities including text analytics; facial detection, speech and vision recognition; natural language understanding, and more.\n\nContainer support in Azure AI services allow developers to use the same rich APIs that are available in Azure but with the flexibility that comes with containers. See [Container support in Azure AI services](http://aka.ms/cognitive-services-containers) for details.\n\n[Speech to Text](https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/cognitive-services/speech-service/speech-container-howto) from the [Speech](https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/cognitive-services/speech-service/) service enables your applications, tools, or devices to convert text into human-like synthesized speech. Using custom option, you can create and fine-tune custom voices unique to your product or brand. All it takes to get started are a handful of audio files and the associated transcriptions.\n\n## Featured tags\n\n- `latest`\ndocker pull mcr.microsoft.com/azure-cognitive-services/speechservices/custom-text-to-speech\n\n## Related repositories\n\n+ [Speech-to-Text](https://hub.docker.com/_/microsoft-azure-cognitive-services-speechservices-speech-to-text)\n+ [Custom Speech-to-Text](https://hub.docker.com/_/microsoft-azure-cognitive-services-speechservices-custom-speech-to-text)\n+ [Neural Text-to-Speech](https://hub.docker.com/_/microsoft-azure-cognitive-services-speechservices-neural-text-to-speech)\n+ [Language Detection](https://hub.docker.com/_/microsoft-azure-cognitive-services-speechservices-language-detection)\n+ [Azure AI services Images](https://hub.docker.com/_/microsoft-azure-cognitive-services): Azure AI services is a set of APIs, SDKs and container images that enables developers to integrate ready-made AI directly into their applications.\n\n## Configuration\n\nSee the [configuration documentation](https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/cognitive-services/speech-service/speech-container-configuration) for how to configure this image.\n\n## Usage\n\nSee the [How-to](https://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/?linkid=2140450) for how to use this image.\n\n## Related Information\n\n+ [Speech-to-Text Azure Cognitive Service](https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/cognitive-services/speech-service/speech-container-howto)\n+ [Container Support in Azure AI services](http://aka.ms/cognitive-services-containers)\n+ [Azure AI services](http://aka.ms/cognitive-services)\n+ [Azure Portal](http://portal.azure.com)\n\n## Support\n\nReport feedback or issues on [Stack Overflow](https://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/?linkid=2056278) using tag azure-cognitive-services.\n\n## License\n\n- Legal Notice: [Container License Information](https://aka.ms/mcr/osslegalnotice)\n\n\nNotice: Copyright © Microsoft Corporation 2020. This Azure AI services Container image is made available to you under the [terms governing your subscription to Microsoft Azure Services](https://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/?linkid=2018657) (including the [Online Services Terms](https://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/?linkid=2018760)). If you do not have a valid Azure subscription, then you may not use this container.","readmeBase":null,"publisher":{"name":"Microsoft","url":"https://mcr.microsoft.com/","official":true,"verified":true},"registered":null,"updated":"2026-09-23T10:33:59.7158531+00:00","catego